    sentences:
    - Aye, I've known Thom longer than he's been drinkin' ale, funny that.
    - I pulled him off before he broke the lad, or his mug arm. Priorities, you see.
    - Ah, this place'd be dull without him. Just wish he'd spill less of the entertainment.
